{"events":[{"tStartMs":131,"dDurationMs":2667,"segs":[{"utf8":"(upbeat music)"}]},{"tStartMs":7830,"dDurationMs":2790,"segs":[{"utf8":"- So many people sent me this simulation"}]},{"tStartMs":10620,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"of water pouring through a maze by Bergman Joe."}]},{"tStartMs":13260,"dDurationMs":1320,"segs":[{"utf8":"And it makes sense that you sent it to me"}]},{"tStartMs":14580,"dDurationMs":3060,"segs":[{"utf8":"'cause this is the kind of thing that I would make for real."}]},{"tStartMs":17640,"dDurationMs":3570,"segs":[{"utf8":"So of course when I saw it, I had to make it for real."}]},{"tStartMs":21210,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"I actually made four mazes in total,"}]},{"tStartMs":23850,"dDurationMs":2280,"segs":[{"utf8":"a simpler one and a more complex one,"}]},{"tStartMs":26130,"dDurationMs":2850,"segs":[{"utf8":"and I also made large versions of those two mazes."}]},{"tStartMs":28980,"dDurationMs":1830,"segs":[{"utf8":"Let's look at the small mazes first,"}]},{"tStartMs":30810,"dDurationMs":2250,"segs":[{"utf8":"because when you see what happens with those,"}]},{"tStartMs":33060,"dDurationMs":2940,"segs":[{"utf8":"it'll be obvious why I made the larger versions."}]},{"tStartMs":36000,"dDurationMs":2490,"segs":[{"utf8":"And by the way, this simulated version"}]},{"tStartMs":38490,"dDurationMs":2940,"segs":[{"utf8":"does eventually fill up completely with water"}]},{"tStartMs":41430,"dDurationMs":1350,"segs":[{"utf8":"and it's very satisfying."}]},{"tStartMs":42780,"dDurationMs":1860,"segs":[{"utf8":"But if you want to see that ending,"}]},{"tStartMs":44640,"dDurationMs":2820,"segs":[{"utf8":"you'll have to go to Bergman Joe's profile,"}]},{"tStartMs":47460,"dDurationMs":1080,"segs":[{"utf8":"link in the description."}]},{"tStartMs":48540,"dDurationMs":2070,"segs":[{"utf8":"Okay, so here's the simpler maze first."}]},{"tStartMs":50610,"dDurationMs":3660,"segs":[{"utf8":"And what we find brilliantly is that the water simply solves"}]},{"tStartMs":54270,"dDurationMs":3750,"segs":[{"utf8":"the maze without taking any wrong turns at all."}]},{"tStartMs":58020,"dDurationMs":1290,"segs":[{"utf8":"And actually that makes sense"}]},{"tStartMs":59310,"dDurationMs":2130,"segs":[{"utf8":"because every time the water comes up"}]},{"tStartMs":61440,"dDurationMs":1500,"segs":[{"utf8":"against an incorrect path,"}]},{"tStartMs":62940,"dDurationMs":3150,"segs":[{"utf8":"well, the air inside the path has nowhere to go."}]},{"tStartMs":66090,"dDurationMs":1950,"segs":[{"utf8":"So while the water is trying to push itself"}]},{"tStartMs":68040,"dDurationMs":1320,"segs":[{"utf8":"into the incorrect path,"}]},{"tStartMs":69360,"dDurationMs":3540,"segs":[{"utf8":"the air pressure inside that closed space is pushing back."}]},{"tStartMs":72900,"dDurationMs":3240,"segs":[{"utf8":"If I had to characterize this as a maze solving algorithm,"}]},{"tStartMs":76140,"dDurationMs":1590,"segs":[{"utf8":"the algorithm would be something like,"}]},{"tStartMs":77730,"dDurationMs":4080,"segs":[{"utf8":"try all paths simultaneously using air pressure,"}]},{"tStartMs":81810,"dDurationMs":833,"segs":[{"utf8":"which is cool."}]},{"tStartMs":82643,"dDurationMs":1657,"segs":[{"utf8":"When the tank runs out it's fun to watch"}]},{"tStartMs":84300,"dDurationMs":2490,"segs":[{"utf8":"the air bubbles solve the maze as well."}]},{"tStartMs":86790,"dDurationMs":1350,"segs":[{"utf8":"And actually it's quite different"}]},{"tStartMs":88140,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"to Bergman Joe's simulation"}]},{"tStartMs":90060,"dDurationMs":3120,"segs":[{"utf8":"where the water eventually tries every path,"}]},{"tStartMs":93180,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"even after it's found the solution."}]},{"tStartMs":94890,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"What about the more complex maze?"}]},{"tStartMs":96630,"dDurationMs":2970,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, first one, I chose the maze where the solve path"}]},{"tStartMs":99600,"dDurationMs":3993,"segs":[{"utf8":"takes the player all the way back up to the very top again."}]},{"tStartMs":105750,"dDurationMs":3210,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, already something seems to be amiss,"}]},{"tStartMs":108960,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"like there shouldn't be any water here,"}]},{"tStartMs":111690,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"or at least not yet."}]},{"tStartMs":113430,"dDurationMs":2700,"segs":[{"utf8":"And there shouldn't be any water here either,"}]},{"tStartMs":116130,"dDurationMs":1800,"segs":[{"utf8":"or at least there shouldn't be if this maze"}]},{"tStartMs":117930,"dDurationMs":3390,"segs":[{"utf8":"is following the same rules as the previous maze."}]},{"tStartMs":121320,"dDurationMs":1620,"segs":[{"utf8":"So what's going on here?"}]},{"tStartMs":122940,"dDurationMs":1830,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, the explanation is quite simple."}]},{"tStartMs":124770,"dDurationMs":2760,"segs":[{"utf8":"I just didn't build a watertight maze."}]},{"tStartMs":127530,"dDurationMs":1500,"segs":[{"utf8":"The reason I didn't build a watertight maze"}]},{"tStartMs":129030,"dDurationMs":1950,"segs":[{"utf8":"is because it's really difficult."}]},{"tStartMs":130980,"dDurationMs":2910,"segs":[{"utf8":"Like I've got three layers of laser cut acrylic here,"}]},{"tStartMs":133890,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"a black layer, that's the maze itself,"}]},{"tStartMs":135660,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"and two clear layers sandwiching the black layer."}]},{"tStartMs":138060,"dDurationMs":2220,"segs":[{"utf8":"And the best way to bond these layers together"}]},{"tStartMs":140280,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"is with solvent that literally dissolves the acrylic"}]},{"tStartMs":143010,"dDurationMs":2430,"segs":[{"utf8":"on both sides so that they weld together"}]},{"tStartMs":145440,"dDurationMs":1590,"segs":[{"utf8":"when the solvent evaporates."}]},{"tStartMs":147030,"dDurationMs":2850,"segs":[{"utf8":"That's easy enough when you're bonding the black layer"}]},{"tStartMs":149880,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"to the first clear layer."}]},{"tStartMs":151620,"dDurationMs":3270,"segs":[{"utf8":"The solvent simply seeps between the two bits of acrylic."}]},{"tStartMs":154890,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"But then when you put the second clear layer on top,"}]},{"tStartMs":157530,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"well, how'd you get the solvent in there?"}]},{"tStartMs":159300,"dDurationMs":833,"segs":[{"utf8":"A fun side note."}]},{"tStartMs":160133,"dDurationMs":1447,"segs":[{"utf8":"One thing you realize very quickly"}]},{"tStartMs":161580,"dDurationMs":2490,"segs":[{"utf8":"when you laser cut a maze is that mazes"}]},{"tStartMs":164070,"dDurationMs":2100,"segs":[{"utf8":"are always made of two separate pieces."}]},{"tStartMs":166170,"dDurationMs":1980,"segs":[{"utf8":"I mean, it's obvious when you think about it,"}]},{"tStartMs":168150,"dDurationMs":1350,"segs":[{"utf8":"but it's quite cool to see."}]},{"tStartMs":169500,"dDurationMs":1890,"segs":[{"utf8":"Actually a maze becomes very easy to solve"}]},{"tStartMs":171390,"dDurationMs":2100,"segs":[{"utf8":"if you color the two parts separately."}]},{"tStartMs":173490,"dDurationMs":2700,"segs":[{"utf8":"But anyway, why did I build the larger mazes?"}]},{"tStartMs":176190,"dDurationMs":1950,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, look, I stated that the reason"}]},{"tStartMs":178140,"dDurationMs":3870,"segs":[{"utf8":"water doesn't go in here is because there is air in the way."}]},{"tStartMs":182010,"dDurationMs":2070,"segs":[{"utf8":"But why doesn't the air just bubble out"}]},{"tStartMs":184080,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"so the water can get in?"}]},{"tStartMs":185820,"dDurationMs":1860,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, it's because of surface tension."}]},{"tStartMs":187680,"dDurationMs":2040,"segs":[{"utf8":"The air is unable to bubble past"}]},{"tStartMs":189720,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"to the surface tension of the water."}]},{"tStartMs":191430,"dDurationMs":2070,"segs":[{"utf8":"So if we make the maze bigger"}]},{"tStartMs":193500,"dDurationMs":3330,"segs":[{"utf8":"until surface tension isn't significant anymore,"}]},{"tStartMs":196830,"dDurationMs":3450,"segs":[{"utf8":"we should expect the maze to be solved in a different way."}]},{"tStartMs":200280,"dDurationMs":1680,"segs":[{"utf8":"We should expect the water to use"}]},{"tStartMs":201960,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"a different solving algorithm."}]},{"tStartMs":203880,"dDurationMs":2790,"segs":[{"utf8":"Maybe something closer to what Bergman Joe showed"}]},{"tStartMs":206670,"dDurationMs":1260,"segs":[{"utf8":"in his simulation."}]},{"tStartMs":207930,"dDurationMs":1170,"segs":[{"utf8":"By the way, for the larger maze,"}]},{"tStartMs":209100,"dDurationMs":3510,"segs":[{"utf8":"I had the genius idea of laser cutting thin channels"}]},{"tStartMs":212610,"dDurationMs":3210,"segs":[{"utf8":"into the outer clear acrylic so I could squirt"}]},{"tStartMs":215820,"dDurationMs":2580,"segs":[{"utf8":"the solvent in once the clear sheet was in place."}]},{"tStartMs":218400,"dDurationMs":2940,"segs":[{"utf8":"But anyway, here's the simple maze in action."}]},{"tStartMs":221340,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"And you can see without the power of surface tension,"}]},{"tStartMs":223740,"dDurationMs":3450,"segs":[{"utf8":"the water finds the lowest possible place it can go to."}]},{"tStartMs":227190,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"Sometimes momentum plays a part"}]},{"tStartMs":228900,"dDurationMs":3030,"segs":[{"utf8":"so it will fill certain paths before others as a result."}]},{"tStartMs":231930,"dDurationMs":2190,"segs":[{"utf8":"But broadly without surface tension,"}]},{"tStartMs":234120,"dDurationMs":3540,"segs":[{"utf8":"the water tries more paths before finding the correct one."}]},{"tStartMs":237660,"dDurationMs":2760,"segs":[{"utf8":"If I had to describe it in terms of a solving algorithm,"}]},{"tStartMs":240420,"dDurationMs":2460,"segs":[{"utf8":"it would be something like, always take the path"}]},{"tStartMs":242880,"dDurationMs":3300,"segs":[{"utf8":"that takes you lower until you can't anymore,"}]},{"tStartMs":246180,"dDurationMs":2130,"segs":[{"utf8":"and then take the next lowest path."}]},{"tStartMs":248310,"dDurationMs":2010,"segs":[{"utf8":"We'll get to the more complex maze in a second."}]},{"tStartMs":250320,"dDurationMs":2880,"segs":[{"utf8":"But first, let's compare this to Bergman Joe's simulation."}]},{"tStartMs":253200,"dDurationMs":1980,"segs":[{"utf8":"More of the maze becomes full of water,"}]},{"tStartMs":255180,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"but it doesn't fill up like it does in Bergman Joe's."}]},{"tStartMs":257910,"dDurationMs":2520,"segs":[{"utf8":"Like water can never get into this region,"}]},{"tStartMs":260430,"dDurationMs":2580,"segs":[{"utf8":"or this region, or any of these regions."}]},{"tStartMs":263010,"dDurationMs":1080,"segs":[{"utf8":"And you can see why."}]},{"tStartMs":264090,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"Again, it's air pressure."}]},{"tStartMs":265860,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"Except it's not surface tension"}]},{"tStartMs":267600,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"that's holding the water back,"}]},{"tStartMs":269370,"dDurationMs":1890,"segs":[{"utf8":"it's just the geometry of the thing."}]},{"tStartMs":271260,"dDurationMs":1740,"segs":[{"utf8":"Like air would have to go down"}]},{"tStartMs":273000,"dDurationMs":2250,"segs":[{"utf8":"before it could go up in this scenario."}]},{"tStartMs":275250,"dDurationMs":3330,"segs":[{"utf8":"So it simply doesn't because air is less dense than water."}]},{"tStartMs":278580,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"So my hunch is that what's going on"}]},{"tStartMs":280500,"dDurationMs":2040,"segs":[{"utf8":"in Bergman Joe's simulation"}]},{"tStartMs":282540,"dDurationMs":2880,"segs":[{"utf8":"is that there is no air in his simulation."}]},{"tStartMs":285420,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"It'd be very difficult for me to recreate"}]},{"tStartMs":287190,"dDurationMs":1170,"segs":[{"utf8":"that with my setup."}]},{"tStartMs":288360,"dDurationMs":3030,"segs":[{"utf8":"Like even if I could do this in a vacuum,"}]},{"tStartMs":291390,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"well, in a vacuum the water would just boil."}]},{"tStartMs":294120,"dDurationMs":3750,"segs":[{"utf8":"Maybe I could try it with a liquid that doesn't boil"}]},{"tStartMs":297870,"dDurationMs":990,"segs":[{"utf8":"in a vacuum."}]},{"tStartMs":298860,"dDurationMs":1320,"segs":[{"utf8":"That sounds hard."}]},{"tStartMs":300180,"dDurationMs":1440,"segs":[{"utf8":"Here's the more complex maze."}]},{"tStartMs":301620,"dDurationMs":1770,"segs":[{"utf8":"There is a slight leak here,"}]},{"tStartMs":303390,"dDurationMs":3360,"segs":[{"utf8":"but it's water leaking from the tank to the outside world."}]},{"tStartMs":306750,"dDurationMs":2190,"segs":[{"utf8":"I don't think there's any significant leaks happening"}]},{"tStartMs":308940,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"within the maze itself, which is a huge relief."}]},{"tStartMs":311670,"dDurationMs":1560,"segs":[{"utf8":"And just like with the simpler maze,"}]},{"tStartMs":313230,"dDurationMs":3180,"segs":[{"utf8":"the water goes to all the lowest parts it can do"}]},{"tStartMs":316410,"dDurationMs":3150,"segs":[{"utf8":"before it's locked out by the geometry."}]},{"tStartMs":319560,"dDurationMs":2310,"segs":[{"utf8":"They say that if you are ever stuck in a maze,"}]},{"tStartMs":321870,"dDurationMs":4410,"segs":[{"utf8":"just put one hand on the wall and keep walking forwards"}]},{"tStartMs":326280,"dDurationMs":1980,"segs":[{"utf8":"and you'll eventually get out the maze."}]},{"tStartMs":328260,"dDurationMs":3960,"segs":[{"utf8":"Though, I suppose if there are two possible paths"}]},{"tStartMs":332220,"dDurationMs":3630,"segs":[{"utf8":"through the maze, then the maze will necessarily be made"}]},{"tStartMs":335850,"dDurationMs":3180,"segs":[{"utf8":"of three parts instead of the two parts of acrylic"}]},{"tStartMs":339030,"dDurationMs":1530,"segs":[{"utf8":"that I showed you before."}]},{"tStartMs":340560,"dDurationMs":2910,"segs":[{"utf8":"And if you happen to put your hand on the middle part"}]},{"tStartMs":343470,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"then you'll just be walking around forever."}]},{"tStartMs":345390,"dDurationMs":2550,"segs":[{"utf8":"But anyway, one thing I really wasn't expecting"}]},{"tStartMs":347940,"dDurationMs":2910,"segs":[{"utf8":"with this water maze was that the whole thing"}]},{"tStartMs":350850,"dDurationMs":3900,"segs":[{"utf8":"grinds to a halt when there's still water left in the tank."}]},{"tStartMs":354750,"dDurationMs":1500,"segs":[{"utf8":"And I think that's because there are lots"}]},{"tStartMs":356250,"dDurationMs":2790,"segs":[{"utf8":"of little bits of surface tension all around the maze"}]},{"tStartMs":359040,"dDurationMs":1650,"segs":[{"utf8":"that need to be overcome."}]},{"tStartMs":360690,"dDurationMs":2190,"segs":[{"utf8":"But together, those little bits of surface tension"}]},{"tStartMs":362880,"dDurationMs":3270,"segs":[{"utf8":"add up to enough resistance so that the pressure of water"}]},{"tStartMs":366150,"dDurationMs":2730,"segs":[{"utf8":"from the tank just isn't enough to force everything through."}]},{"tStartMs":368880,"dDurationMs":2430,"segs":[{"utf8":"Like there's a little bit of surface tension here"}]},{"tStartMs":371310,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"that's preventing the water coming over this lip."}]},{"tStartMs":373950,"dDurationMs":3510,"segs":[{"utf8":"Another bit of surface tension here, here, here, here, here."}]},{"tStartMs":377460,"dDurationMs":2490,"segs":[{"utf8":"They're all resisting the flow of water slightly,"}]},{"tStartMs":379950,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"but together they present a significant amount"}]},{"tStartMs":381660,"dDurationMs":833,"segs":[{"utf8":"of resistance."}]},{"tStartMs":382493,"dDurationMs":1357,"segs":[{"utf8":"It's a bit like those coin games."}]},{"tStartMs":383850,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"You know, you roll your coin in,"}]},{"tStartMs":385560,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"it gets pushed off the first shelf,"}]},{"tStartMs":387480,"dDurationMs":2280,"segs":[{"utf8":"but then nothing happens on the second shelf."}]},{"tStartMs":389760,"dDurationMs":2580,"segs":[{"utf8":"Or maybe something does fall off the second shelf,"}]},{"tStartMs":392340,"dDurationMs":3000,"segs":[{"utf8":"but there's no way anything's happening on the third shelf."}]},{"tStartMs":395340,"dDurationMs":2400,"segs":[{"utf8":"The final thing I want to show you is what happens"}]},{"tStartMs":397740,"dDurationMs":4620,"segs":[{"utf8":"if I change the color of the water once the maze is solved."}]},{"tStartMs":402360,"dDurationMs":870,"segs":[{"utf8":"It's fun, isn't it?"}]},{"tStartMs":403230,"dDurationMs":4170,"segs":[{"utf8":"You can see that the red dye solves the maze"}]},{"tStartMs":407400,"dDurationMs":4380,"segs":[{"utf8":"and slowly starts to creep into those stagnant areas."}]},{"tStartMs":411780,"dDurationMs":2550,"segs":[{"utf8":"So there you go, water can solve a maze."}]},{"tStartMs":414330,"dDurationMs":3270,"segs":[{"utf8":"It doesn't look anything like Bergman Joe's simulation,"}]},{"tStartMs":417600,"dDurationMs":2130,"segs":[{"utf8":"not that Bergman Joe's simulation is wrong,"}]},{"tStartMs":419730,"dDurationMs":3150,"segs":[{"utf8":"it's just simulating something that I couldn't recreate"}]},{"tStartMs":422880,"dDurationMs":1380,"segs":[{"utf8":"here in my studio."}]},{"tStartMs":424260,"dDurationMs":2280,"segs":[{"utf8":"When I was given careers advice at school,"}]},{"tStartMs":426540,"dDurationMs":3270,"segs":[{"utf8":"I can tell you for sure that making science videos"}]},{"tStartMs":429810,"dDurationMs":3360,"segs":[{"utf8":"on YouTube was not one of the suggestions that they made,"}]},{"tStartMs":433170,"dDurationMs":2280,"segs":[{"utf8":"mainly because YouTube didn't exist back then."}]},{"tStartMs":435450,"dDurationMs":2070,"segs":[{"utf8":"But also I feel like they probably weren't asking"}]},{"tStartMs":437520,"dDurationMs":900,"segs":[{"utf8":"the right questions."}]},{"tStartMs":438420,"dDurationMs":2340,"segs":[{"utf8":"So how do you find good careers advice?"}]},{"tStartMs":440760,"dDurationMs":2460,"segs":[{"utf8":"Well, for people that are interested in finding"}]},{"tStartMs":443220,"dDurationMs":3300,"segs":[{"utf8":"a fulfilling career that makes a difference in the world,"}]},{"tStartMs":446520,"dDurationMs":1830,"segs":[{"utf8":"then I strongly recommend checking out"}]},{"tStartMs":448350,"dDurationMs":2520,"segs":[{"utf8":"the sponsor of this video 80,000 Hours."}]},{"tStartMs":450870,"dDurationMs":930,"segs":[{"utf8":"And I'll say at the top"}]},{"tStartMs":451800,"dDurationMs":2280,"segs":[{"utf8":"that what they offer is absolutely free."}]},{"tStartMs":454080,"dDurationMs":3150,"segs":[{"utf8":"They're a nonprofit organization that focuses"}]},{"tStartMs":457230,"dDurationMs":3330,"segs":[{"utf8":"on helping people find careers that solve"}]},{"tStartMs":460560,"dDurationMs":1710,"segs":[{"utf8":"the world's biggest problems."}]},{"tStartMs":462270,"dDurationMs":1950,"segs":[{"utf8":"And there are two things that I really like about it."}]},{"tStartMs":464220,"dDurationMs":2160,"segs":[{"utf8":"The first is that it's evidence-based."}]},{"tStartMs":466380,"dDurationMs":2220,"segs":[{"utf8":"Their insights come from 10 years of research"}]},{"tStartMs":468600,"dDurationMs":2340,"segs":[{"utf8":"alongside academics at Oxford University."}]},{"tStartMs":470940,"dDurationMs":2640,"segs":[{"utf8":"The second thing I like is just the sheer breadth"}]},{"tStartMs":473580,"dDurationMs":3330,"segs":[{"utf8":"of different tools available on their website."}]},{"tStartMs":476910,"dDurationMs":2550,"segs":[{"utf8":"You could start by looking at their problem profiles,"}]},{"tStartMs":479460,"dDurationMs":833,"segs":[{"utf8":"for example."}]},{"tStartMs":480293,"dDurationMs":2857,"segs":[{"utf8":"Those are the things in the world that need fixing."}]},{"tStartMs":483150,"dDurationMs":2520,"segs":[{"utf8":"Or you could start with their decision-making tools"}]},{"tStartMs":485670,"dDurationMs":4050,"segs":[{"utf8":"that help you to find a career based on what you are like."}]},{"tStartMs":489720,"dDurationMs":2910,"segs":[{"utf8":"Or you can dive straight into looking at specific careers."}]},{"tStartMs":492630,"dDurationMs":3240,"segs":[{"utf8":"There's even a podcast if you enjoy learning that way."}]},{"tStartMs":495870,"dDurationMs":1980,"segs":[{"utf8":"And then there's the job board,"}]},{"tStartMs":497850,"dDurationMs":3180,"segs":[{"utf8":"which they have curated based on what their research"}]},{"tStartMs":501030,"dDurationMs":2490,"segs":[{"utf8":"says are high-impact careers."}]},{"tStartMs":503520,"dDurationMs":1950,"segs":[{"utf8":"The best way to get started is to go"}]},{"tStartMs":505470,"dDurationMs":4590,"segs":[{"utf8":"to 80,000 dollars.org/steve to be sent a free copy"}]},{"tStartMs":510060,"dDurationMs":2850,"segs":[{"utf8":"of their in-depth career guide in which you can learn"}]},{"tStartMs":512910,"dDurationMs":2550,"segs":[{"utf8":"about what makes a high-impact career,"}]},{"tStartMs":515460,"dDurationMs":2130,"segs":[{"utf8":"get new ideas for impactful paths,"}]},{"tStartMs":517590,"dDurationMs":2190,"segs":[{"utf8":"make a new plan based on what you've learned,"}]},{"tStartMs":519780,"dDurationMs":1320,"segs":[{"utf8":"and put it into action."}]},{"tStartMs":521100,"dDurationMs":1560,"segs":[{"utf8":"The link is also in the description"}]},{"tStartMs":522660,"dDurationMs":2220,"segs":[{"utf8":"so check out 80,000 Hours today."}]},{"tStartMs":524880,"dDurationMs":990,"segs":[{"utf8":"I hope you enjoyed this video."}]},{"tStartMs":525870,"dDurationMs":1920,"segs":[{"utf8":"If you did, don't forget to hit subscribe,"}]},{"tStartMs":527790,"dDurationMs":3585,"segs":[{"utf8":"And the algorithm thinks you'll enjoy this video next."}]},{"tStartMs":531375,"dDurationMs":2667,"segs":[{"utf8":"(upbeat music)"}]}]}